  "faqRecordSaleQ": "How do I record a sale?",
  "faqRecordSaleA": "Tap the + button, choose the outlet and product, set the quantity and any discount, then tap Submit. The sale counts toward your target straight away.",
  "faqAddOutletQ": "My shop isn't in the outlet list. What do I do?",
  "faqAddOutletA": "When choosing an outlet, tap \"Add new outlet\" and fill in the shop's details. It is assigned to you and appears for your admin as a new customer.",
  "faqTargetQ": "How is my target progress calculated?",
  "faqTargetA": "Your monthly target is set by your admin. Achievement is your completed sales this month divided by the target. The daily amount needed spreads what's left over the remaining working days (the weekly holiday is not counted).",
  "faqWrongSaleQ": "I entered a sale by mistake. Can I delete it?",
  "faqWrongSaleA": "Sales can't be edited or deleted from the app. Ask your Team Head or admin to cancel it; a cancelled sale no longer counts toward your totals.",
  "faqNotificationsQ": "I'm not getting notifications.",
  "faqNotificationsA": "Check that Push notifications is on under Settings, and that notifications are allowed for SalesysX in your phone's settings. You need to be signed in to receive them.",
  "faqPasswordQ": "I forgot my password.",
  "faqPasswordA": "Ask your admin to reset it. They will give you a temporary password; sign in with it and change it under Settings > Change Password.",
